        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana OHP620, Solid Brass Off-Set Pull Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis beautiful 6-3/16\" Off-Set Pull Set is made out of solid brass. It comes packaged as a set of pulls (2 pulls) with a back-to-back mounting kit with a 4-3/16\" center to center. Comes standard for 1-1/8\" to 1-3/8\" thick doors. Available 9 finishes, it comes packaged with matching back to back mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-OHP620-Specifications.gif?v=1704354773\" width=\"341\" height=\"235\" border=\"0\" atl=\"6-3/16 Inch Off-Set Pull Set Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Deltana OHP620 6-3/16 Inches Back-to-Back Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mounting: 4-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Pull Length: 6-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/8\" to 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OHP620.pdf?v=1691095373\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana OHP620 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
