                "description": "Solid Brass Off-Set Pull Set Deltana OHP620 - This beautiful 6-3/16 Inch Off-Set Pull Set is made out of solid brass. It comes packaged as a set of pulls (2 pulls) with a back-to-back mounting kit with a 4-3/16 inch center to center. Comes standard for 1-1/8 inch to 1-3/8 inch thick doors. Available 9 finishes, it comes packaged with matching back to back mounting hardware.",
